        Stable Cinemetrics : Structured Taxonomy and Evaluation for Professional Video Generation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chatterjee%2C+A">Agneet Chatterjee</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Entezari%2C+R">Rahim Entezari</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhuravinskyi%2C+M">Maksym Zhuravinskyi</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lapin%2C+M">Maksim Lapin</a>, 
      
