    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        TAU: A Benchmark for Cultural Sound Understanding Beyond Semantics
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lin%2C+Y">Yi-Cheng Lin</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+Y">Yu-Hua Chen</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Dong%2C+J">Jia-Kai Dong</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Huang%2C+Y">Yueh-Hsuan Huang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+S">Szu-Chi Chen</a>, 
      
